WEBVTT

00:00:12.660 --> 00:00:15.910
One hundred years have passed
since the Battle of Galluah Plains,

00:00:15.910 --> 00:00:19.120
where King Kyle defeated
the Dark Lord Angmund.

00:00:19.120 --> 00:00:22.620
The Demons rise again,
threatening the world

00:00:22.620 --> 00:00:25.790
and spreading fear and unrest to all.

00:00:25.790 --> 00:00:28.080
The Black Edge band of mercenaries
were hired by Orvelia

00:00:28.080 --> 00:00:31.240
to hunt down the Demonic invaders.

00:00:31.240 --> 00:00:37.370
However, their true goal
is to exact revenge on Orvelia.

00:00:37.370 --> 00:00:42.910
I want you to perform feats
more impressive than the knights.

00:00:42.910 --> 00:00:45.580
I will lay the groundwork for you.

00:00:47.330 --> 00:00:48.790
Yes, understood.

00:02:18.910 --> 00:02:23.910
<i></i>The Target

00:02:18.910 --> 00:02:23.910
<i></i>of Hatred

00:03:11.540 --> 00:03:13.410
You're back.

00:03:13.410 --> 00:03:16.410
Yes. The mission was a success.

00:03:16.410 --> 00:03:21.410
Good. Behl wants to see you--
he said he has business with you.

00:03:21.410 --> 00:03:22.620
With me...?

00:03:22.620 --> 00:03:25.580
Behl is speaking with the astrologer.

00:03:25.580 --> 00:03:29.040
The kingdom will soon launch
a formal operation to hunt demons.

00:03:29.040 --> 00:03:34.410
It will surely provide you with
more opportunities to show your powers.

00:03:39.830 --> 00:03:42.370
Are you sure, Ophelia?

00:03:42.370 --> 00:03:46.870
Yes. The day of Lea,
the Goddess of Darkness, approaches.

00:03:46.870 --> 00:03:51.290
On that day, when the "nocturnal sun"
crosses with the moon,

00:03:51.290 --> 00:03:54.040
terror will engulf this world.

00:03:55.330 --> 00:03:57.450
That's what the stars say?

00:03:57.450 --> 00:03:59.620
Yes, Princess Scarlet.

00:03:59.620 --> 00:04:03.700
So Angmund, the Dark Lord, is returning...?

00:04:03.700 --> 00:04:05.950
That is what the stars whisper to me.

00:04:07.200 --> 00:04:14.910
Unlike 100 years ago, Orvelia does not
have the Holy Sword Aea, or King Kyle.

00:04:14.910 --> 00:04:19.700
The king has fallen ill, so there is
no way for us to resist the Dark Lord.

00:04:19.700 --> 00:04:22.330
Worry not, Behl.

00:04:22.330 --> 00:04:26.660
We the knights of Orvelia will defend
the kingdom in father's stead.

00:04:26.660 --> 00:04:31.410
I will not let some Dark Lord
trample over Orvelia!

00:04:31.410 --> 00:04:35.040
Ophelia, continue to keep track
of the movements of the stars.

00:04:35.040 --> 00:04:36.240
Yes.

00:04:40.620 --> 00:04:41.660
You're...

00:04:41.660 --> 00:04:43.490
You've returned.

00:04:43.490 --> 00:04:46.120
Yes. I heard you wanted to speak to me.

00:04:46.120 --> 00:04:50.490
I wanted you to meet
the commander in chief of the knights.

00:04:50.490 --> 00:04:53.910
You must be Riheet of the Black Edge?

00:04:53.910 --> 00:04:55.160
Who are you?

00:04:55.160 --> 00:04:56.910
Mind your tongue!

00:04:56.910 --> 00:05:00.660
This is her royal highness, Princess Scarlet!

00:05:02.330 --> 00:05:06.240
I have been told about your help
with hunting down the Demons.

00:05:06.240 --> 00:05:10.790
I was the one that asked Behl
for an opportunity to meet you.

00:05:10.790 --> 00:05:15.120
Princess Scarlet is also
the commander in chief of the knights.

00:05:16.200 --> 00:05:18.950
I've heard that your men are quite useful.

00:05:18.950 --> 00:05:22.620
I want the Black Edge to join us knights.

00:05:22.620 --> 00:05:26.990
From now on, we will ask you
to coordinate with us. Is that acceptable?

00:05:26.990 --> 00:05:31.450
Of course, that would be
a true honor, Princess Scarlet.

00:05:31.450 --> 00:05:36.910
I was told that you would be very hard
to deal with, but you seem honest.

00:05:36.910 --> 00:05:41.450
There is a regular meeting
tomorrow morning. Join us.

00:05:52.700 --> 00:05:54.950
We're joining the knights?!

00:05:54.950 --> 00:05:56.410
Yes.

00:05:56.410 --> 00:05:59.240
That's a huge step up from grunt mercenary!

00:05:59.240 --> 00:06:00.660
We did it!

00:06:02.200 --> 00:06:05.580
I'm not glad to get a dumb promotion.

00:06:05.580 --> 00:06:10.290
Our goal is to take over
and control Orvelia, remember?

00:06:10.290 --> 00:06:16.790
Joining the knights means being able
to trick them and take them out quickly.

00:06:16.790 --> 00:06:18.910
O-Oh, I see.

00:06:18.910 --> 00:06:21.830
Everyone, be even more alert than before.

00:06:21.830 --> 00:06:24.160
Don't cause any trouble in town.

00:06:24.160 --> 00:06:26.160
Yeah, understood.

00:06:26.160 --> 00:06:29.200
Try to keep up your good boy act, Tamm.

00:06:29.200 --> 00:06:31.450
Stop treating me like a child!

00:06:31.450 --> 00:06:33.740
But you are a child.

00:06:33.740 --> 00:06:36.290
I'm not a child!

00:06:34.910 --> 00:06:38.790
Who would have expected, though,
that the princess is the commander?

00:06:36.290 --> 00:06:38.330
Yuck, you sneezed on me!

00:06:38.330 --> 00:06:40.660
How childish of you.

00:06:38.790 --> 00:06:40.660
Yeah...

00:06:40.660 --> 00:06:45.200
She doesn't appear easy to deal with,
unlike the others.

00:06:52.290 --> 00:06:56.240
Demonic activity is rising
steadily, day over day.

00:06:56.240 --> 00:07:02.040
Perhaps the astrologer is right,
and the Demon Lord is coming back soon.

00:07:02.040 --> 00:07:06.080
The only thing we can do for now is
to hunt down the Demons that appear.

00:07:07.830 --> 00:07:09.120
You're here.

00:07:10.990 --> 00:07:12.740
This is Riheet, from the Black Edge.

00:07:14.120 --> 00:07:20.490
As you know, they have fought
numerous Demons in defense of Orvelia.

00:07:20.490 --> 00:07:23.580
He will be joining us as an ally of the knights!

00:07:25.450 --> 00:07:27.450
I beg your pardon, but I must speak!

00:07:27.450 --> 00:07:31.830
They are dark elves. Surely you must
be aware that they are the same race as Ilya,

00:07:31.830 --> 00:07:34.830
who defiled Lua, the Goddess of Light!

00:07:34.830 --> 00:07:37.330
Yes, of course I do.

00:07:37.330 --> 00:07:42.120
I also know Ilya's crimes have
nothing to do with the Black Edge.

00:07:45.370 --> 00:07:50.830
Any who oppose the addition of
the Black Edge as allies, speak now!

00:07:53.580 --> 00:07:56.410
I have no opposition, Princess.

00:07:56.410 --> 00:07:59.410
It would be reassuring
to have you join us knights.

00:07:59.410 --> 00:08:01.990
Is there anything else that
you must speak about, Zierro?

00:08:03.700 --> 00:08:05.950
No, Your Highness.

00:08:05.950 --> 00:08:10.450
Oh, I know! I can use your services right away.

00:08:10.450 --> 00:08:15.160
There are dirty rats scurrying
around in town these days.

00:08:15.160 --> 00:08:19.240
We would love to get your help
to chase them out of Orvelia.

00:08:19.240 --> 00:08:20.330
Hey...!

00:08:20.330 --> 00:08:24.450
I heard you will do anything for money.

00:08:24.450 --> 00:08:27.620
Of course I will pay you handsomely.

00:08:27.620 --> 00:08:30.580
Keep that, as a down payment.

00:08:30.580 --> 00:08:31.700
Zierro!

00:08:40.660 --> 00:08:44.450
If the Demons infiltrate this place,

00:08:44.450 --> 00:08:46.700
no amount of money can help you.

00:08:48.160 --> 00:08:50.370
Perhaps you should shift your
focus away from your rats,

00:08:50.370 --> 00:08:52.950
and towards a plan to defeat the Demons.

00:08:56.540 --> 00:08:59.160
Starting from today,
the Black Edge are our friends.

00:08:59.160 --> 00:09:03.200
I will not condone anyone who
insult them or disrespect them.

00:09:03.200 --> 00:09:04.950
Mark my words, all of you!

00:09:04.950 --> 00:09:06.120
Yes!

00:09:07.330 --> 00:09:08.240
Yes...

00:09:08.240 --> 00:09:10.490
Let's resume our meeting.

00:09:10.490 --> 00:09:13.490
Demia, you mentioned that
you have new information?

00:09:13.490 --> 00:09:19.160
Yes. Numerous Demons were sighted
near the Forest of Elidora.

00:09:19.160 --> 00:09:23.040
What should our first move be...?

00:09:23.040 --> 00:09:25.120
I'd like to hear your opinion.

00:09:29.240 --> 00:09:32.580
We should first send in
some scouts to investigate.

00:09:36.120 --> 00:09:38.160
However...

00:09:38.160 --> 00:09:43.080
At the same time, we should also
heavily reorganize the defending knights.

00:09:43.080 --> 00:09:44.330
Why is that?

00:09:44.330 --> 00:09:46.950
The castle and surrounding town
are well defended,

00:09:46.950 --> 00:09:51.330
but the highways and other
regions are defenseless.

00:09:51.330 --> 00:09:55.410
It is almost like we are only interested
in defending ourselves,

00:09:55.410 --> 00:09:57.410
and nobody else.

00:10:00.660 --> 00:10:03.330
I see. You do indeed have a keen eye.

00:10:09.370 --> 00:10:14.120
Why?! Why should those dark elves
be allowed to join the knights?!

00:10:18.120 --> 00:10:20.290
What do you want, Zierro?

00:10:20.290 --> 00:10:26.950
Father, honored guests, I must speak with you.

00:10:28.160 --> 00:10:30.620
I understand your argument.

00:10:30.620 --> 00:10:36.290
It is not ideal for us either to
have dark elves defend Orvelia.

00:10:36.290 --> 00:10:39.700
However, we have no choice
but to get their help.

00:10:39.700 --> 00:10:45.370
Agreed. Princess Scarlet also has
high hopes for the Black Edge.

00:10:45.370 --> 00:10:48.330
We cannot ignore them.

00:10:48.330 --> 00:10:49.910
Father!

00:10:50.580 --> 00:10:52.910
The decision has already been made.

00:10:52.910 --> 00:10:55.950
Once the Demons are gone,
so will our need for the Black Edge.

00:10:55.950 --> 00:10:57.830
Until then, you must be patient.

00:11:04.660 --> 00:11:10.330
Ah, I forgot to buy drinks.

00:11:10.330 --> 00:11:11.990
Go ahead without me.

00:11:11.990 --> 00:11:13.080
All right.

00:11:26.290 --> 00:11:28.740
Give me this one. How much?

00:11:28.740 --> 00:11:29.870
Oh.

00:11:29.870 --> 00:11:32.490
You guys took out the Demons, right?

00:11:32.490 --> 00:11:34.200
Huh?

00:11:34.200 --> 00:11:36.740
Go ahead, enjoy the bread.

00:11:37.620 --> 00:11:39.200
It's on me.

00:11:43.200 --> 00:11:45.540
You heard the man--go ahead, take it.

00:11:45.540 --> 00:11:47.160
Uh, sure...

00:12:00.200 --> 00:12:03.660
What is this? They totally flipped on us.

00:12:08.620 --> 00:12:11.290
I suppose I don't mind getting free stuff.

00:12:23.540 --> 00:12:25.080
What do you want?

00:12:29.240 --> 00:12:31.490
Don't cause any trouble in town.

00:12:38.950 --> 00:12:41.450
Who are you?!

00:12:41.450 --> 00:12:45.870
We don't need dark elves in this town.
You're nothing but trouble!

00:12:46.290 --> 00:12:49.120
We've got to exterminate dirty rats!

00:13:10.870 --> 00:13:12.240
You--!

00:13:20.040 --> 00:13:21.620
Let's go!

00:13:21.620 --> 00:13:23.080
You're not getting away!

00:13:26.490 --> 00:13:27.660
Hey, get up!

00:13:29.870 --> 00:13:32.160
You have a fever!

00:13:32.160 --> 00:13:33.950
What's wrong?!

00:13:33.950 --> 00:13:36.240
You're hurt! Are you okay?!

00:13:41.620 --> 00:13:43.200
Good.

00:13:43.200 --> 00:13:44.620
I'll get a doctor!

00:13:44.620 --> 00:13:46.490
There is no need.

00:13:46.490 --> 00:13:47.790
But...

00:13:47.790 --> 00:13:53.490
We're considered troublemakers here.
I don't want to cause more commotion.

00:13:54.580 --> 00:13:56.120
Can you walk, Tamm?

00:13:56.120 --> 00:13:57.790
Y-Yeah...

00:13:57.790 --> 00:13:59.660
Here, hold on.

00:14:06.910 --> 00:14:11.120
Why didn't you tell anyone about your fever?

00:14:11.120 --> 00:14:11.960
Sorry.

00:14:11.960 --> 00:14:13.580
Come on.

00:14:13.580 --> 00:14:16.330
I'm impressed that you held back, Tamm.

00:14:16.330 --> 00:14:20.870
If you had drawn your sword,
it would have made a huge scene.

00:14:22.080 --> 00:14:27.910
Those guys called me a rat, but the way
they ran, I'd say they were the rats today.

00:14:29.330 --> 00:14:33.870
There are dirty rats scurrying
around in town these days.

00:14:36.830 --> 00:14:38.410
Tamm needs to rest.

00:14:38.410 --> 00:14:40.120
I'll carry him to the bed.

00:14:40.120 --> 00:14:41.540
Thanks.

00:14:43.660 --> 00:14:45.870
Who attacked Tamm?!

00:14:45.870 --> 00:14:49.990
I'll find out and kill them all!

00:14:49.990 --> 00:14:53.490
You do that and we'd all get sentenced to death.

00:14:54.990 --> 00:14:58.080
Are you saying we can't do
anything about this?!

00:14:58.080 --> 00:14:59.660
Exactly.

00:15:08.660 --> 00:15:11.200
Was it someone under Zierro's influence?

00:15:11.200 --> 00:15:13.950
According to what my friend heard,
that seemed likely.

00:15:13.950 --> 00:15:16.950
It probably was him.

00:15:16.950 --> 00:15:20.040
Zierro is one of the candidates
to become Princess Scarlet's betrothed.

00:15:20.040 --> 00:15:23.330
He was always eager to score
an accomplishment to get her attention.

00:15:23.330 --> 00:15:26.790
Perhaps he is jealous of you.

00:15:26.790 --> 00:15:29.200
His father is a timid man, but...

00:15:29.790 --> 00:15:32.660
The son is quite bold, is he not?

00:15:33.410 --> 00:15:38.700
Whatever his reasons, there's no doubt
that he wants us out of Orvelia.

00:15:38.700 --> 00:15:41.660
If he succeeds, that would be
bad for you, too, wouldn't it?

00:15:43.700 --> 00:15:45.540
Zierro...

00:15:45.540 --> 00:15:48.240
I will remind the nobles.

00:15:48.240 --> 00:15:52.950
You investigate him and try to find evidence.

00:15:52.950 --> 00:15:54.330
Understood.

00:15:57.120 --> 00:16:01.080
I heard the news from Behl.
Was your friend all right?

00:16:01.080 --> 00:16:04.410
Yes. He is fine.

00:16:06.620 --> 00:16:11.410
We should be thanking Black Edge
for your help against the Demons.

00:16:11.410 --> 00:16:14.830
I'm sorry that this happened to you.

00:16:17.490 --> 00:16:20.580
Excuse me, Princess Scarlet.

00:16:20.580 --> 00:16:24.080
There are certain papers that
require your signature, immediately.

00:16:24.080 --> 00:16:25.450
Understood.

00:16:25.450 --> 00:16:28.160
I heard you ran into some trouble yesterday.

00:16:28.160 --> 00:16:32.830
Why don't you go look after your friends
instead of loitering here?

00:16:33.620 --> 00:16:36.490
Thank you for your trouble.
You are dismissed.

00:16:36.490 --> 00:16:37.740
Yes.

00:16:45.990 --> 00:16:47.830
Welcome back, Brother.

00:16:47.830 --> 00:16:49.290
How is Tamm?

00:16:49.290 --> 00:16:53.870
He's much better. Azal and Zucca
are taking turns caring for him.

00:16:53.870 --> 00:16:55.200
I see.

00:16:56.580 --> 00:16:58.200
What is this?

00:16:58.200 --> 00:17:01.290
I think they took this from
the guys that attacked Tamm.

00:17:09.410 --> 00:17:10.700
Brother?

00:17:25.120 --> 00:17:26.450
Whoa!

00:17:28.330 --> 00:17:29.790
What's going on?!

00:17:51.540 --> 00:17:53.160
G-Go away!

00:18:08.450 --> 00:18:10.160
You recognize this, don't you?

00:18:10.580 --> 00:18:12.910
S-So what?!

00:18:12.910 --> 00:18:15.240
You sent those men to attack my friend.

00:18:15.240 --> 00:18:20.080
I-I don't know what you're talking about!
You'll regret threatening me!

00:18:21.450 --> 00:18:25.410
Y-Yes! It's me, I sent my men!

00:18:34.120 --> 00:18:37.240
Stop, no!

00:18:38.450 --> 00:18:40.870
P-Please, stop!

00:18:40.870 --> 00:18:44.910
I promise I won't ever let him do
something stupid! I beg you, forgive him!

00:18:46.240 --> 00:18:49.790
Stay away from my friends.

00:18:51.330 --> 00:18:52.870
U-Understood!

00:19:04.160 --> 00:19:07.660
Thanks for getting them for me, Riheet.

00:19:07.660 --> 00:19:13.790
They won't trouble us anymore.
In fact, they should listen to us from now on.

00:19:13.790 --> 00:19:20.080
I'm not satisfied yet. I want to kill
everyone that hurt Tamm!

00:19:20.080 --> 00:19:23.080
I'm glad we didn't bring you along.

00:19:26.240 --> 00:19:31.450
That said, it's good to see that
some of the people in Orvelia have a heart.

00:19:31.450 --> 00:19:32.660
What?

00:19:32.660 --> 00:19:37.120
I mean, that princess, Scarlet.

00:19:37.120 --> 00:19:42.370
I heard she apologized for what
happened to me. I can't believe she's a royal.

00:19:42.370 --> 00:19:43.990
Don't be an idiot.

00:19:43.990 --> 00:19:49.990
While our families were being murdered,
the princess had a nice life in the castle.

00:19:49.990 --> 00:19:52.540
She's no different from those rotten nobles.

00:19:52.540 --> 00:19:55.410
Don't trust the people of Orvelia.

00:19:55.410 --> 00:19:57.950
Yeah, I know.

00:20:08.830 --> 00:20:11.120
It's even more red than usual.

00:20:11.120 --> 00:20:12.450
Yeah.

00:20:12.450 --> 00:20:16.080
Staring at that star always calms my mind.

00:20:22.290 --> 00:20:28.040
Don't cry, Ripine.
Those Orvelian guys enjoy hurting us.

00:20:28.040 --> 00:20:30.620
Crying would be giving them
exactly what they want.

00:20:30.620 --> 00:20:32.040
But...

00:20:32.040 --> 00:20:35.740
Hold your head high.
Then the tears won't fall.

00:20:39.410 --> 00:20:40.700
Oh...

00:20:45.240 --> 00:20:48.490
I will avenge our mother, one day.

00:20:51.950 --> 00:20:55.410
We've finally come this far, Brother.

00:20:56.450 --> 00:20:57.910
Yeah...

00:22:44.200 --> 00:22:46.540
So, you're finally awake.

00:22:46.540 --> 00:22:48.910
It's you, Maria.

00:22:48.910 --> 00:22:53.620
The Day of Lea approaches.

00:22:53.620 --> 00:22:57.740
Yes. Time to bring back
the Dark Lord, right, Malduk?

00:22:57.740 --> 00:23:02.120
Of course. What about the Holy Sword Aea?

00:23:03.330 --> 00:23:05.910
I looked all over, but I couldn't find it.

00:23:05.910 --> 00:23:09.450
Find it, before we bring the Dark Lord back.

00:23:09.450 --> 00:23:10.990
I know.

00:23:41.080 --> 00:23:45.330
Now, let's start this exciting banquet!

00:23:46.910 --> 00:23:51.990
We stopped by a town and met a girl.

00:23:51.990 --> 00:23:57.120
After losing her parents, the girl,
Elise, is drowning in sorrow.

00:23:57.120 --> 00:23:58.330
In her eyes, I saw a familiar shadow...

00:23:58.330 --> 00:24:00.840
<i></i>Memories in

00:23:58.330 --> 00:24:00.840
<i></i>the Eyes

00:23:58.330 --> 00:24:00.790
In her eyes, I saw a familiar shadow...
